01:15:22.960 --> 01:15:26.690
ltu waktunya jalan.

01:15:26.730 --> 01:15:27.960
Ya.

01:15:28.000 --> 01:15:31.770
Aku uh...

01:15:31.770 --> 01:15:35.710
